  block (0, 0): 6x6 weights of 4 levels in one plane, 3 partitions (seed 470: the closest to the entries' pattern, 1 texel off it), endpoints 148, 242, 67, 121, 0, 80 (luminance, 20 levels), bytes 08 d1 3a e0 95 48 30 00 00 00 00 00 5f 0a 37 29
  decodes to [0, 0.101960786, 0.101960786, 0.20784314, 0.262745112, 0.313725501, 0.403921574, 0.474509805, 0.580392182, 0.580392182, 0.701960802, 0.701960802, 0.827450991, 0.827450991, 0.949019611, 0.949019611]
